Package: bedrocktrader
Title: Retrieve Minecraft Bedrock Villager Trade Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person('Rento', 'Saijo', email = 'rentosaijo0527@gmail.com', role = c('aut', 'cre', 'cph'), comment = c(ORCID = '0009-0008-4919-7349'))
Description: Provides normalized vanilla Minecraft Bedrock 1.26.30.5 villager
    trade data, including progression, selection, item choices, modeled
    enchantments, contextual restrictions, and offer probabilities in flat
    base R data frames.
